2:T5c9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get from Horw to the Pilatus gondola station?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We drive you to Fräkmüntegg valley station in Kriens in about 10 minutes. From there, the gondola whisks you up to the mountain. Return pickup can be arranged for any time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the University of Applied Sciences far from Horw station?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The campus is about 1.5 km from the station – a 20-minute walk or 3-minute taxi ride. We frequently transport students, especially during bad weather or with heavy materials."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you take me to Strandbad Horw beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Summer beach transfers are very popular. We can also coordinate pickup times based on when you want to leave the beach."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the fare from Horw to Lucerne city center?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Typical fares range from CHF 20-30 depending on exact locations. The train is faster for station-to-station travel, but a taxi works better for door-to-door convenience."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you serve the Kastanienbaum area?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we cover all of Horw municipality including Kastanienbaum. The peninsula's restaurants and sailing facilities are frequent destinations."}}]}0:{"buildId":"Lij9gpsWiFPMXDL2lTdi2","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TaxiService\",\"name\":\"Nova Taxi Horw\",\"description\":\"Taxi service in Horw near Lucerne. Mount Pilatus transfers, airport connections, lakeside transport. Nova Taxi 24/7.\",\"url\":\"https://www.nova-taxi.com/en/ort/horw\",\"telephone\":\"+41766113131\",\"email\":\"info@nova-taxi.com\",\"areaServed\":{\